- op: discuss  # 0c92
  at: '2026-07-30T17:20:26Z'  # 0c92
  by: agent  # 0c92
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0c92
  clock: 3  # 0c92
  nonce: 0c92  # 0c92
  message: "Re-measured 2026-07-30 on a fresh self-survey (40979 nodes / 138626 edges). The filed figures are stale in BOTH directions, mostly because the registries themselves moved:\n\n  filed:    18/54 edge_types, 26/140 symbol_kinds, 33/125 evidence_types\n  measured: 17/25 edge_types, 29/152 symbol_kinds, 39/125 evidence_types\n\nThe edge_type denominator fell 54 -> 25 because the endpoint_shape and pending_classification axes were drained to empty (ADR-0023 fold, register pt.24/pt.25), so coverage there is now 68% rather than 33% — the gap largely closed by deleting unemitted vocabulary rather than by emitting more. symbol_kinds went the other way (140 -> 152 registered) while emitted rose only 26 -> 29, so that ratio worsened.\n\nNo action taken. Recorded because the item is framed as a coverage OBSERVATION and its numbers are the whole content; anyone acting on it should start from these rather than re-deriving them."  # 0c92
- op: discuss  # 9fd7
  at: '2026-11-01T10:56:00Z'  # 9fd7
  by: agent  # 9fd7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9fd7
  clock: 4  # 9fd7
  nonce: 9fd7  # 9fd7
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc4/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review: the registries now hold 25 edge types, 157 symbol kinds and 130 evidence types. The filed 54/140/125 and the July 152/125 counts are stale. Today's .hypergumbo/self-analysis.json (scripts/generate-architecture, packages/ only, 57844 nodes) emits 13/25 edge types, 19/157 symbol kinds and 32/130 evidence types, with none outside the registries. This scope differs from the July whole-repo survey, so the drop from 17/29/39 is not a like-for-like comparison. producer_coherence checks producer->registry only, so the observation stands. MECHANISM: Axis registries are permissive; no gate checks that each registered value has an observed producer."  # 9fd7
